OL,3,GNEWSADiary found in rubbish tip unlocks
OL,4,Asoldier's story
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We had a man bring in this diary. He'd
OL,7,Ffound it 30 years beforehand in a
OL,8,Frubbish tip. We had decided that
OL,9,Fbecause there was a local angle to
OL,10,Fthis, we would actually put his diary
OL,11,Fon display, just with a single red
OL,12,Frose."
